cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the accompanying article and this software."
title: "INTERACT streaming speech-to-sign benchmark (s2sbench)"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark that measures how streaming speech recognition affects a real-time
  dictionary-based International Sign avatar. It replays AMI meeting audio through four streaming
  methods, maps the released words to the INTERACT International Sign dictionary and simulates
  sequential avatar playback, scoring the transcript, the signs and their timing.
